imary-fixed\">ST</span>\n</div>\n<span class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -right-1 bg-tertiary text-on-tertiary font-label-sm text-[8px] font-bold px-1 rounded-full\">88%</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-6 h-[1px] bg-outline-variant/40 my-1\"></div>\n<!-- Rail Shortcut Icons -->\n<button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container shadow-sm active:scale-95 transition-transform\" title=\"Home\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\" style=\"font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;\">home</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container active:scale-95 transition-transform\" title=\"Virtual Try-On\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">styler</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container active:scale-95 transition-transform\" title=\"My Closet\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">checkroom</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container active:scale-95 transition-transform\" title=\"Wardrobe Health\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">insights</span>\n</button>\n<div class=\"flex-1\"></div>\n<button class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-secondary hover:text-on-surface active:scale-95 transition-transform\" title=\"App Settings\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\">tune</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n<!-- Primary Content Stream / Scrollable Canvas -->\n<div class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-4 pt-3 space-y-5 custom-scrollbar\">\n<!-- User Greeting & Real-time Live Weather Forecast Banner -->\n<section class=\"space-y-3\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div>\n<h1 class=\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface font-bold\">Good morning, Sarah</h1>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary\">London · Schedule has 3 styling syncs today</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Dynamic Weather & Climate Insight Card -->\n<div class=\"bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-2xl p-3.5 border border-outline-variant/30 shadow-[0px_4px_20px_rgba(30,34,41,0.04)] flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n<div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-600\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[24px]\" style=\"font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;\">light_mode</span>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span class=\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold text-on-surface\">72°F Sunny</span>\n<span class=\"bg-surface-container px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md text-label-sm font-label-sm text-secondary font-medium\">Mild Humidity</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5\">Lightweight breathable layers recommended</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-outline text-[18px]\">thermostat</span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- Occasion Filter Horizontal Carousel -->\n<section class=\"space-y-2\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<span class=\"font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold\">Today's Agenda</span>\n<span class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-semibold\">Edit Context</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 overflow-x-auto custom-scrollbar pb-1 -mx-1 px-1\">\n<!-- Selected Pill -->\n<button class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-on-surface text-surface-container-lowest px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full font-label-md text-label-md font-medium shadow-sm transition-transform active:scale-95\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[15px]\" style=\"font-variation-setting